=== DELETE /v1/instances/{instance}
kind: route
group: Instances
src: api/src/external_api/instance_endpoints.rs :: #[endpoint { method = DELETE, path = "/v1/instances/{instance}",
doc: Deletes a stopped or failed instance. Its boot disk is deleted with it.
---
